{
  "_comment": "Generic example for Acme. Copy into .claude/settings.json (project) or ~/.claude/settings.json (user). Deny rules hold in bypassPermissions; the plugin hooks are the second layer. Patterns match command prefixes, so keep the hooks on as well.",
